# Upper Harbour — .gitignore
# Anything in this list will not be committed to the public repo and will not
# be deployed to upperharbour.ca. Use this to keep secrets, internal docs,
# and operational state out of the public deployment.
#
# Critical rule: never commit secrets to this repo, even temporarily.
# Even after deletion, secrets remain in git history and must be revoked.

# ── Secrets & environment ────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.env
secrets.json
credentials.json
.npmrc
.netrc

# ── Internal-only documentation ──────────────────────────────────
# Anything in .private/ is for internal reference only and never deployed.
# Keep working notes, session logs, strategy docs, AI orchestration files
# here instead of at the repo root.
.private/
*.private.md
*.local.md
SESSION-LOG.md
CLAUDE.md
BUSINESS-SHERPA.md
business-sherpa.md
SITE-BIBLE.md
CLASSIFICATION-RUBRIC.md
UPDATE-GUIDE.md
CONTINUATION-MANUAL.md

# ── OS / editor cruft ────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── Python build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ── Node build artifacts (if added later) ────────────────────────
node_modules/
.next/
dist/
build/

# ── Local test / scratch files ───────────────────────────────────
/tmp/
/scratch/
*.bak
*.tmp
